  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NL Branding to enhance the impact of PSD Toolkit projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project concerns the support of NL Branding for several PSD Toolkit projects, among them Impact Clusters and missions, in PSD Toolkit countries.The aim is to increase the impact of PSD Toolkit projects, and thus the impact on the development of the local private sector, as well as increased the visibility of the Netherlands as a partner for mutual growth and achieving SDGs, through effective and clear communication.</narrative>
  </description>
